 function editorMarkup(){return `<div class="ms-shell" id="messageStudio"><section class="f-panel"><div class="f-panel-head"><div><h2>Composer container</h2><p>Susun pesan Discord dengan container, teks, media, tombol, dan menu.</p></div><span>✦</span></div><div class="ms-top-actions"><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msNew">PESAN BARU</button><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msImport">IMPORT JSON</button><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msExport">EXPORT JSON</button><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msAddContainer">+ CONTAINER</button><input class="ms-hidden" type="file" id="msImportFile" accept="application/json,.json"></div><details class="ms-json-panel"><summary>Buat draf pengumuman dengan AI</summary><p class="ms-empty">Khusus owner bot. Poin dikirim ke provider AI dan memakai kuota; jangan masukkan rahasia. AI bisa keliru. Draf tidak dikirim ke Discord otomatis.</p><label for="msAiPoints">Poin pengumuman</label><textarea id="msAiPoints" class="ms-json" rows="3" maxlength="1200" placeholder="Isi tujuan, waktu dan informasi penting"></textarea><div class="ms-inline-actions"><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msAiGenerate">BUAT DRAF AI</button></div><label for="msAiDraft">Draf untuk diperiksa dan disunting</label><textarea id="msAiDraft" class="ms-json" rows="6" maxlength="1500"></textarea><div class="ms-inline-actions"><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msAiApply">PAKAI DI KOMPONEN TERPILIH</button></div><p id="msAiStatus" class="ms-empty" role="status"></p></details><details class="ms-json-panel"><summary>Tempel atau salin JSON</summary><p class="ms-empty">Muat JSON Message Studio atau Discord. Lampiran perlu diunggah ulang.</p><label for="msJsonText" class="ms-json-label">JSON pesan</label><textarea id="msJsonText" class="ms-json" rows="8" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Tempel JSON di sini"></textarea><div class="ms-inline-actions"><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msJsonLoad">MUAT JSON</button><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msJsonShow">TAMPILKAN JSON EDITOR</button><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msJsonCopy">SALIN JSON EDITOR</button></div></details><div class="ms-warning">Webhook dikelola bot; jangan tempel URL atau token webhook. Tombol respons dan menu hanya tersedia dalam mode bot. File maksimal 5 MB; total request maksimal 8 MB termasuk pengkodean.</div><div class="ms-delivery"><label class="f-field"><span><b>Channel tujuan</b><small>Pilih channel teks yang dapat diakses bot.</small></span><select id="msChannel"></select></label><label class="f-field"><span><b>Mode pengirim</b><small>Akun bot atau webhook yang dibuat bot.</small></span><select id="msSender"><option value="bot">Akun ZentixBot</option><option value="webhook">Webhook terkelola</option></select></label></div><div id="msIdentityFields" class="ms-delivery"><label class="f-field"><span><b>Nama webhook</b><small>Opsional, maksimal 80 karakter.</small></span><input id="msWebhookName" maxlength="80"></label><label class="f-field"><span><b>Avatar webhook</b><small>Opsional, URL HTTPS.</small></span><input id="msWebhookAvatar" maxlength="2000" placeholder="https://…"></label></div><p class="ms-warning" id="msEditingNote" hidden></p><div class="ms-workspace"><aside class="ms-tree"><div class="ms-tree-head"><span>STRUKTUR PESAN</span><span>MAX 4</span></div><div class="ms-tree-body" id="msTree"></div></aside><section class="ms-inspector"><div class="ms-inspector-head"><span>EDITOR KOMPONEN</span><span>V2</span></div><div class="ms-inspector-body" id="msInspector"></div></section><aside class="ms-preview"><div class="ms-preview-head"><span>PREVIEW DISCORD</span><span>CONTAINER</span></div><div class="ms-discord" id="msPreview"></div></aside></div><section class="ms-actions" aria-label="Simpan dan kirim pesan"><div class="ms-action-section"><div class="ms-action-heading"><strong>Simpan template</strong><small>Simpan susunan untuk digunakan lagi.</small></div><div class="ms-template-actions"><label class="ms-template-field" for="msTemplateName">Nama template<input id="msTemplateName" maxlength="80" placeholder="Misalnya: Aturan server"></label><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msSaveTemplate">SIMPAN TEMPLATE</button></div></div><div class="ms-action-section"><div class="ms-action-heading"><strong>Kirim pesan</strong><small>Periksa preview dan channel tujuan sebelum mengirim.</small></div><div class="ms-send-actions"><button class="f-primary" type="button" id="msSend">KIRIM KE DISCORD ↗</button><button class="f-primary" type="button" id="msUpdate" hidden>SIMPAN PERUBAHAN ↗</button><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msTest">KIRIM UJI</button><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msSendCopy" hidden>KIRIM SALINAN</button></div></div><div class="ms-action-section ms-danger-section" id="msManageMessage" hidden><div class="ms-action-heading"><strong>Kelola pesan tercatat</strong><small>Hapus pesan dari Discord, atau lepas riwayat tanpa menghapus pesan. Tombol respons dan menu interaktif tidak lagi aktif setelah riwayat dilepas.</small></div><div class="ms-send-actions"><button class="f-outline ms-danger-button" type="button" id="msDeleteMessage" hidden>HAPUS PESAN</button><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msForgetMessage" hidden>LEPAS RIWAYAT</button></div></div></section><p class="f-muted ms-status" id="msStatus" aria-live="polite"></p><details class="ms-warning ms-jobs"><summary>Pesan terjadwal</summary><p>Status tidak pasti mungkin sudah terkirim: periksa Discord sebelum menghapus atau menjadwalkan ulang. Menghapus riwayat tidak menarik pesan yang sudah terkirim.</p><button class="f-outline" type="button" id="msJobsRefresh">MUAT JADWAL</button><div id="msJobs" aria-live="polite"></div></details></section></div>`;}
 function libraryMarkup(){return `<div class="ms-library-grid" id="messageStudioLibrary"><section class="f-panel"><div class="f-panel-head"><div><h2>Template tersimpan</h2><p>Dokumen container yang dapat dibuka, disunting, diduplikasi, dan dihapus.</p></div><span>◇</span></div><div id="msTemplates" class="ms-library-list"><p class="ms-empty">Memuat…</p></div></section><section class="f-panel"><div class="f-panel-head"><div><h2>Pesan terkirim</h2><p>Riwayat ini menampilkan channel dan pengirim, bukan nama template. Hanya pesan dari Message Studio yang dapat diedit atau dihapus di sini.</p></div><span>↗</span></div><div id="msMessages" class="ms-library-list"><p class="ms-empty">Memuat…</p></div></section></div>`;}
